<<widget "genericactions">><<nobr>>
<!--
Mostly at an idea stage, 
list of verbs you should be able to consider doing when just standing at some location
mainly I like the idea of you sitting/laying down to write your diary in unusual locations but adding a thing that just adds write diary link to any location passage seemed weird(making the sidebar diary check if you're at suitable location give you some link to click if so might be a better solution if I want just that.) so figured having a thing that'll automatically add links to generic actions based on some variables might be good.
-->
<<set $return to $passage>>
<!--<<done>>-->
<<timed 0s>>
<!--I'm hoping this makes stuff appear at the bottom even if say <<effects>> used this... It does not but figuring out how to make it do that seems like too much trouble to bother with when I'm not sure I even want this(worst case scenario we manually add this to everywhere it should be)  -->
<br>
Actions
<br>
<<link [[Write diary|Open Diary]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Study]]>><</link>>

<<if $arousal gte 5000 or _lewdattitude or _private>>
	<<link [[Masturbate|]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

<<if $crowds isnot undefined and $crowds gte 1>>
	<<link [[Pickpockets]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

<</timed>>
<!--<</done>>-->

<</nobr>><</widget>>

<<widget "idleactions">><<nobr>>
<!--
Event requires you to wait giving you a chance to do something while you wait.
Possible use cases:
Gloryhole
Purity certificate waiting in a booth for checkup
Hospital wait times
Inside cranegame
In a locker
-->
<<set $continuelink to $args[0]>>

<<link [[Wait]]>><</link>>
<<link [[Daydream]]>><</link>>
<<link [[Fantasize]]>><</link>>
<<link [[Rest]]>><</link>>
<<link [[Sing]]>><</link>>
<<link [[Write diary|Open Diary]]>><</link>>

<</nobr>><</widget>>
